Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["W_G: the connection sector", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.993711356637582*^9, 
  3.9937113786702557`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"43ceaab4-ca92-46fb-a8d3-\
33f837e532b5"],

Cell["\<\
W_G is the coefficient of G(-p) omega(p) in delta^(0) S_2 = 0:
W_G_{rho sigma tau alpha}(p) = D_{phi^0}^{mu nu}_alpha(p) KhG_{mu nu rho \
sigma tau}(-p)
  + 2 D_{G^0}^lambda_{mu nu alpha}(p) KGG_lambda^{mu nu}_{rho sigma tau} = 0.
Here the mixed kernel carries -p, consistently with its connection argument.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ab5a72eb-4c89-4057-b444-299d33c53ec8"],

