Cell["\<\
There are 9 scalar equations for 15 quadratic coefficients. The quadratic \
identities alone leave a six-parameter family in the generic-dimensional \
solution below. The cubic identities W31 and W32 subsequently remove all \
relative freedom, leaving an overall normalization.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.993716245930296*^9, 3.9937162646930923`*^9}, {
