Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["12) Summary and Verification Scope", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"5b5047e6-ba93-4261-bfc3-ceae5bcffa22"],

Cell["\<\
Kernel bases: 4, 6, 5 and 16 elements (Tables V-VIII and Appendix C of the \
paper), independent in the stated generic-momentum domain for Nd >= 4. The \
mixed basis includes a factor i. Projection-set sizes at equal field momenta \
are 3, 6, 7, 23, 20 and 95 (Table III); the last set is dependent at Nd = 4.

Solution sequence (Table IV): W31 gives Khh = 0. After that restriction, W_h \
and W_G impose nine constraints on the eleven mixed/connection coefficients, \
leaving ahG and cGG. W32 sets ahG = 0 and expresses all sixteen cubic \
coefficients through cGG. Substitution in W33 and W34 gives no further \
constraint.

With cGG = 1/(Nd-1), the only nonzero coefficients are bhG = -1, aGG = -1, \
cGG = 1/(Nd-1), v1 = -1 and v7 = 1/(Nd-1). These names refer to the notebook \
basis order. In the orbit notation and slot order of Appendix E:
K^{phi G} = -i S[p_lambda eta_mu rho eta_nu sigma];
K^{GG} = -S[eta_lambda sigma eta_mu rho eta_nu tau] + S[eta_lambda mu eta_nu \
sigma eta_rho tau]/(Nd-1);
V = -S[eta_mu alpha eta_nu sigma eta_lambda tau eta_beta rho] + S[eta_mu \
alpha eta_nu sigma eta_lambda beta eta_rho tau]/(Nd-1).
S denotes the average over the relevant kernel-symmetry orbit. The \
corresponding paper elements are mixed 4, GG 5 and 2, and cubic 16 and 14.

The action is S = integral d^Nd x [-G^lambda_mu nu partial_lambda phi^{mu nu} \
+ (eta + phi)^{mu nu}(-tr(G_mu G_nu) + g_mu g_nu/(Nd-1))], with g_mu = \
G^sigma_mu sigma, kappa = 1 and the normalization of Eq. (5.1). The mixed \
term requires an integration by parts when converting from momentum space.

The full first-order cubic-kernel check compares all eight free indices and \
returns zero when the bootstrap kernel equals the Goldberg-Palatini \
reference. The second-order three-graviton vertex and its comparison with CLM \
are outside the scope of this notebook; the final cell exports the kernels \
for that calculation.\
\>", "Text",
 CellTags->
  "ResultsSummary",ExpressionUUID->"8da13f43-9225-4921-a4e8-a38e043f3f49"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["13) Export for the Separate xAct/CLM Notebook", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"792347ae-3dba-4bbc-8b8f-14b2ed4c5d04"],

Cell["\<\
Evaluate this final cell after solving the bootstrap with symbolic Nd. It \
writes a package-independent Association beside this notebook and reads it \
back to verify serialization. The export contains the normalized GG and phi \
GG kernels, M0 = 2 KGG, and the phi coefficient of M(phi) = 2 V, with slot \
conventions. The inverse and the second-order CLM comparison belong to the \
separate xAct notebook. The full first-order cubic-kernel check above remains \
part of the bootstrap validation.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"436fe0fa-70b8-4521-b380-4d3f30dbb973"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"slots", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
        "m1", ",", "m2", ",", "m3", ",", "m4", ",", "m5", ",", "m6", ",", 
         "m7", ",", "m8"}], "}"}]}], ",", " ", "gg", ",", " ", "cubic", ",", 
      " ", "neutral", ",", " ", "data", ",", " ", "file"}], "}"}], ",", "\n", 
    " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"If", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"!", 
         RowBox[{"ListQ", "[", "subs", "]"}]}], " ", "||", " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"DownValues", "[", "KGG", "]"}], " ", "===", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], " ", "||", " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"DownValues", "[", "V", "]"}], " ", "===", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}]}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
        "Print", "[", 
         "\"\<Export aborted: evaluate the bootstrap solution first.\>\"", 
         "]"}], ";", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Abort", "[", "]"}]}]}], "]"}], ";", "\n", " ", 
     RowBox[{"If", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"ValueQ", "[", "Nd", "]"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
        "Print", "[", "\"\<Export aborted: Nd must remain symbolic.\>\"", 
         "]"}], ";", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Abort", "[", "]"}]}]}], "]"}], ";", "\n", " ", 
     RowBox[{"gg", " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"KGG", "[", 
          RowBox[{
          "m1", ",", "m2", ",", "m3", ",", "m4", ",", "m5", ",", "m6"}], 
          "]"}], " ", "/.", " ", "subs"}], " ", "/.", " ", 
        RowBox[{"cGG", " ", "->", " ", 
         RowBox[{"1", "/", 
          RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{"Nd", "-", "1"}], ")"}]}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
     RowBox[{"cubic", " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"V", "[", 
          RowBox[{
          "m1", ",", "m2", ",", "m3", ",", "m4", ",", "m5", ",", "m6", ",", 
           "m7", ",", "m8"}], "]"}], " ", "/.", " ", "subs"}], " ", "/.", " ", 
        RowBox[{"cGG", " ", "->", " ", 
         RowBox[{"1", "/", 
          RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{"Nd", "-", "1"}], ")"}]}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"neutral", "[", "expr_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"FCI", "[", "expr", "]"}], " ", "/.", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", "\n", "   ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"FeynCalc`Pair", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"FeynCalc`LorentzIndex", "[", 
              RowBox[{"a_", ",", "Nd"}], "]"}], ",", 
             RowBox[{"FeynCalc`LorentzIndex", "[", 
              RowBox[{"b_", ",", "Nd"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], " ", ":>", " ", 
           RowBox[{"GPBootstrapData`Eta", "[", 
            RowBox[{"a", ",", "b"}], "]"}]}], "\n", "   ", "}"}]}], " ", "/.",
         " ", 
        RowBox[{"Thread", "[", 
         RowBox[{"slots", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"Range", "[", "8", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], " ", "/.", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Nd", " ", "->", " ", "GPBootstrapData`Dimension"}]}]}], ";", 
     "\n", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"gg", ",", "cubic"}], "}"}], " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"neutral", " ", "/@", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"gg", ",", "cubic"}], "}"}]}]}], ";", "\n", " ", 
     RowBox[{"If", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"!", 
        RowBox[{"FreeQ", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"gg", ",", "cubic"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"s_Symbol", " ", "/;", " ", 
           RowBox[{"!", 
            RowBox[{"MemberQ", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"{", 
               RowBox[{"\"\<System`\>\"", ",", "\"\<GPBootstrapData`\>\""}], 
               "}"}], ",", 
              RowBox[{"Context", "[", "s", "]"}]}], "]"}]}]}]}], "]"}]}], ",",
        "\n", "  ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
        "Print", "[", 
         "\"\<Export aborted: unresolved coefficients or unsupported tensor \
objects.\>\"", "]"}], ";", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Abort", "[", "]"}]}]}], "]"}], ";", "\n", " ", 
     RowBox[{"data", " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"<|", "\n", "  ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"\"\<SchemaVersion\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "1"}], ",", "\n", 
        "  ", 
        RowBox[{
        "\"\<SourceNotebook\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
         "\"\<Goldberg_Palatini_Bootstrap_en.nb\>\""}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<Created\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
         RowBox[{"DateString", "[", "\"\<ISODateTime\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", "\n",
         "  ", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<KernelVersion\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "$Version"}], ",", 
        "\n", "  ", 
        RowBox[{
        "\"\<FeynCalcVersion\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "$FeynCalcVersion"}], ",", 
        "\n", "  ", 
        RowBox[{
        "\"\<Dimension\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "GPBootstrapData`Dimension"}], 
        ",", "\n", "  ", 
        RowBox[{
        "\"\<Domain\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
         "\"\<Generic symbolic dimension d >= 4; inverse construction \
requires d != 2.\>\""}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
        RowBox[{
        "\"\<Normalization\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
         "\"\<cGG = 1/(Nd-1); action Eq. (5.1); kernels have no extra \
factorials; restore kappa multiplying phi G G.\>\""}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
        RowBox[{
        "\"\<Representation\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
         "\"\<Eta[i,j] is the abstract flat metric between free slots i,j, \
not a component with numerical indices. All kernel indices are raised in the \
FeynCalc representation. Integer slots are labels, not summed indices.\>\""}],
         ",", "\n", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<GGSlots\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
          "\"\<lambda\>\"", ",", "\"\<mu\>\"", ",", "\"\<nu\>\"", ",", 
           "\"\<rho\>\"", ",", "\"\<sigma\>\"", ",", "\"\<tau\>\""}], "}"}]}],
         ",", "\n", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<PhiGGSlots\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
          "\"\<mu\>\"", ",", "\"\<nu\>\"", ",", "\"\<lambda\>\"", ",", 
           "\"\<alpha\>\"", ",", "\"\<beta\>\"", ",", "\"\<rho\>\"", ",", 
           "\"\<sigma\>\"", ",", "\"\<tau\>\""}], "}"}]}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<GGSymmetries\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"2", ",", "3"}], "}"}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"5", ",", "6"}], "}"}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{"1", ",", "2", ",", "3"}], "}"}], ",", 
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{"4", ",", "5", ",", "6"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], 
        ",", "\n", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<PhiGGSymmetries\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"1", ",", "2"}], "}"}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"4", ",", "5"}], "}"}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"7", ",", "8"}], "}"}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{"3", ",", "4", ",", "5"}], "}"}], ",", 
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{"6", ",", "7", ",", "8"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], 
        ",", "\n", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<KGG\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "gg"}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<KPhiGG\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "cubic"}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
        
        RowBox[{"\"\<M0\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
         RowBox[{"2", " ", "gg"}]}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<MPhiCoefficient\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
         RowBox[{"2", " ", "cubic"}]}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
        RowBox[{
        "\"\<MPhiMeaning\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
         "\"\<Contract slots 1,2 of MPhiCoefficient with the lowered \
symmetric phi to form M(phi); the remaining slots describe the two G \
fields.\>\""}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
        RowBox[{
        "\"\<InverseStatus\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
         "\"\<Not exported. Construct or import M0Inverse in the xAct \
notebook and verify its product with this M0 on symmetric connection tensors.\
\>\""}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
        RowBox[{
        "\"\<MixedTerm\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
         "\"\<-G^lambda_mu_nu partial_lambda phi^mu_nu in position space, \
after integration by parts.\>\""}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
        RowBox[{
        "\"\<FourierConvention\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
         "\"\<f(p)=integral exp(+i p.x) f(x); partial on momentum p gives -i \
p.\>\""}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
        RowBox[{
        "\"\<CubicAction\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
         "\"\<G0=M0Inverse partial(phi); L3=kappa M(phi)(G0,G0)/2. CLM \
comparison is performed in a separate notebook.\>\""}]}], "\n", " ", "|>"}]}],
      ";", "\n", " ", 
     RowBox[{"file", " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"FileNameJoin", "[", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"NotebookDirectory", "[", "]"}], ",", 
         "\"\<Goldberg_Palatini_Bootstrap_kernels.wl\>\""}], "}"}], "]"}]}], 
     ";", "\n", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Put", "[", 
      RowBox[{"data", ",", "file"}], "]"}], ";", "\n", " ", 
     RowBox[{"If", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Get", "[", "file", "]"}], " ", "=!=", " ", "data"}], ",", 
       " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Print", "[", "\"\<Export read-back failed.\>\"", "]"}], ";", 
        " ", 
        RowBox[{"Abort", "[", "]"}]}]}], "]"}], ";", "\n", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
      RowBox[{
      "\"\<Bootstrap kernels exported and read back successfully: \>\"", ",", 
       
       RowBox[{"FileNameTake", "[", "file", "]"}]}], "]"}], ";", "\n", " ", 
     RowBox[{"FileNameTake", "[", "file", "]"}]}]}], "\n", "]"}], 
  "\n"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
